      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: Yeah, I know.\n\nThose tall/giant avatars usually couldn't change size, so as a pure desktop user I never knew if they were just created incorrectly for desktop or if it was a VRChat issue. With the scaling features it is now very clear that it wasn't the avatars being created incorrectly.",
