      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It looks like this is being addressed in the new Open Beta version.\n\nSee build `1547` for the ongoing 2024.4.2 beta.\n\n\"- When grasping objects on a flatscreen device (desktop, mobile) the position of your avatar's hand is now consistent for avatars of different scales.\"\n\nI'll give it a test when able.",
