      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This seems to have resolved the issue nicely.\n\nIt even seems to be holding the object a relatively further distance as expected too, which wasn't mentioned in the patch notes. Only issue I see is that the object isn't moved if you are holding it while you change size, would be nice if it was.",
