  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Start client in desktop mode.\n\n2. Be in a normal avatar.\n\n3. Pickup an pickup-able object and notice the distance the object is held from the screen.\n\n4. Use the new avatar scale feature and set it to 5m.\n\n5. Pickup an pickup-able object and notice the distance the object is held from the screen is the same as in step 3, so your now much longer arms are bent. This is even more noticeable from a second-perspective.\n\nThis was also an issue with old avatar scaling workarounds like Gogo Loco and similar.",
